# Settings › Home server › Files & links and Services › Files on the web (docs/HOME-SERVER.md): your shares in a web
# browser (with your web password), share links and the drop-off folder, served as you by hearth-home-server-web on
# port 8097: on this PC's Tailscale address only, or on your home network if you chose that. Off until you turn one of
# them on there (hearth-home-server enables it for your account). Not part of the session starting: a failure here
# never holds anything up.
[Unit]
Description=Hearth home server: files on the web, share links and drop-off

[Service]
ExecStart=/usr/bin/python3 /usr/share/nimbus/desktop/shell/hearth-home-server-web
Restart=on-failure
RestartSec=30
Nice=10

[Install]
WantedBy=default.target
